                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "efd5e30e-78c2-3af6-a74b-87f51ca8ece3",
                        "entry_id": "af786ea0-d935-39a3-b5b4-618bacff368c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "провести черту под чем-либо"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "820ee663-6980-4ab9-bfc2-b4c1c92d2fcb",
                                "sense_id": "efd5e30e-78c2-3af6-a74b-87f51ca8ece3",
                                "text": "«Отлично!» — подумал Пуликен и жирно подчеркнул последнюю строку красным карандашом."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8672edd6-55a8-31ea-a870-398332aa518b",
                        "entry_id": "af786ea0-d935-39a3-b5b4-618bacff368c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "перен. специально отметить, выделить в речи"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "adca4c88-6df7-4b4e-9d28-c3527365a2b5",
                                "sense_id": "8672edd6-55a8-31ea-a870-398332aa518b",
                                "text": "Докладчик подчеркнул, что вступление России в качестве члена в Болонскую декларацию не менее значимо для Европы, чем для России."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1592ba72-47f5-4cb7-85e0-30296d69e05a",
                        "source_entry_id": "af786ea0-d935-39a3-b5b4-618bacff368c",
                        "target_lang_word": "underline",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "underline",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9a540c67-2571-3b87-86f7-301c4f3c738a",
                                        "entry_id": "f9e7c47e-74b4-3498-91d1-70e1da471fdc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A line placed underneath a piece of text in order to provide emphasis or to indicate that it should be viewed in italics or (in electronic documents) that it acts as a hyperlink."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d75085d9-a620-3a5c-b851-0109528104ad",
                                        "entry_id": "f9e7c47e-74b4-3498-91d1-70e1da471fdc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The character _."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncommon"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "242dd30c-ba55-3378-80a1-c7b5c2821804",
                                        "entry_id": "f9e7c47e-74b4-3498-91d1-70e1da471fdc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An announcement of a theatrical performance to follow, placed in an advertisement for the current one."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dcfcaa8a-88d7-3eff-ad87-e4e27069c06b",
                                        "entry_id": "f9e7c47e-74b4-3498-91d1-70e1da471fdc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A caption beneath a photograph (which may have more than one line of text)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "beecd4f6-cb30-4f55-ada6-411968550f79",
                                                "sense_id": "dcfcaa8a-88d7-3eff-ad87-e4e27069c06b",
                                                "text": "Several readers [...] write to point out that the ex-Great Eastern 0-6-0s now classified as \"J20\" in the L.N.E.R. lists, no longer hold the supremacy for power among British 0-6-0 locomotives as suggested in the underline to the photograph of one of them which appeared on p. 100 of the March-April issue."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "underline",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "facb4631-2922-3245-b6c4-045822b0c845",
                                        "entry_id": "f6bd261c-1e77-39b0-a43a-4b626104e595",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To draw a line underneath something, especially to add emphasis."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "90d37ba2-c07c-4f63-af9f-9fb845ce788b",
                                                "sense_id": "facb4631-2922-3245-b6c4-045822b0c845",
                                                "text": "underline the important words in the text"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5a70dee6-1638-357c-b6f5-e43954217505",
                                        "entry_id": "f6bd261c-1e77-39b0-a43a-4b626104e595",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To emphasise or stress something."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9e54715d-9faa-48fc-9732-7d772cd0f8df",
                                                "sense_id": "5a70dee6-1638-357c-b6f5-e43954217505",
                                                "text": "The Midlanders will hope the victory will kickstart a campaign that looked to have hit the buffers, but the sense of trepidation enveloping the Reebok Stadium heading into the new year underlines the seriousness of the predicament facing Owen Coyle's men."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b2c1ee39-dbec-3074-83a4-16bd713fdcfe",
                                        "entry_id": "f6bd261c-1e77-39b0-a43a-4b626104e595",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To influence secretly."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively",
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "32623a80-7c76-4885-84e0-cd6634398820",
                                                "sense_id": "b2c1ee39-dbec-3074-83a4-16bd713fdcfe",
                                                "text": "By mere chance in appearance, though underlined with a providence, they had a full light of the infanta."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "underline",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "318ba918-581b-3153-9f7f-27129f0037e4",
                                        "entry_id": "ff0a27eb-9b3a-3a57-a202-3d6ff58f9270",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Passing under a railway line."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "485f653d-88fa-4865-924e-df2acd5b84df",
                                                "sense_id": "318ba918-581b-3153-9f7f-27129f0037e4",
                                                "text": "Just as it was sometimes necessary to lower the road to take it beneath an underline bridge, so in this case it might be necessary to raise it."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "722c7c16-f280-4f3e-90e7-00a58ed18efe",
                                                "sense_id": "318ba918-581b-3153-9f7f-27129f0037e4",
                                                "text": "A minute was saved by smart working at Ipswich, but soon after came yet another delay, a 10 m.p.h. slack over an underline bridge being reconstructed between Bramford and Claydon."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ef7f8c2b-ed39-4224-a3dd-68c7d8c7fba8",
                                                "sense_id": "318ba918-581b-3153-9f7f-27129f0037e4",
                                                "text": "As to underbridges, the policy is to wait until the small underline bridges become due for renewal when they will be replaced by prestressed concrete structures."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4fe0575c-6f85-4338-af2d-3a25035495c9",
                        "source_entry_id": "af786ea0-d935-39a3-b5b4-618bacff368c",
                        "target_lang_word": "put forward",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "put forward",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3b218781-5c1e-3e71-a878-9d426770e7c9",
                                        "entry_id": "9685d5ac-e0d8-3f25-b79b-9ef14ee11fd4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To propose for consideration."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "idiomatic",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1fb62b9a-7c6a-4c63-85cf-a93c4b56b8ee",
                                                "sense_id": "3b218781-5c1e-3e71-a878-9d426770e7c9",
                                                "text": "The Prime Minister put forward new plans to tackle corruption."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d40e8787-a4ca-428a-843e-7e40ecf7cad7",
                                                "sense_id": "3b218781-5c1e-3e71-a878-9d426770e7c9",
                                                "text": "Democrats, meanwhile, point out that Republicans seem to have made a conscious decision, beginning with the stimulus, to oppose anything the president put forward, dooming any chance of renewed cooperation between the parties."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "197d9c5a-7289-4bae-b094-76cf542e73e3",
                                                "sense_id": "3b218781-5c1e-3e71-a878-9d426770e7c9",
                                                "text": "Another argument for closing Woodhead was simply one of route duplication, and this was the main reason put forward by BR at the time."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c6e0d35f-452f-300d-aff5-55ea60d2b4bd",
                                        "entry_id": "9685d5ac-e0d8-3f25-b79b-9ef14ee11fd4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To change the time in a time zone to a later time."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "idiomatic",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "93efbaba-4da2-41dc-bec9-89c33704e5b2",
                                                "sense_id": "c6e0d35f-452f-300d-aff5-55ea60d2b4bd",
                                                "text": "Don't forget that this Sunday we put the clocks forward an hour."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7eacf8ad-6f22-434f-b60f-7930be18d023",
                                                "sense_id": "c6e0d35f-452f-300d-aff5-55ea60d2b4bd",
                                                "text": "When the clocks are put forward at the introduction of summer time, the long-distance night trains automatically become one hour late, and continue to run late for the remainder of their journeys. […] Similarly, when the clocks are put back in the autumn, the night trains become one hour early."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0c3f0b7e-59ac-4924-970e-5d58636267f5",
                        "source_entry_id": "af786ea0-d935-39a3-b5b4-618bacff368c",
                        "target_lang_word": "souligner",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "souligner",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "44b560a9-9bc0-3c9b-bb94-e6ca0bebe522",
                                        "entry_id": "b3485f47-4904-3a91-8630-3e156a853ba3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Tirer une ligne sous un mot, ou sous plusieurs mots."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7a19d4dc-3d3d-47c7-b41d-9ab3b11af97a",
                                                "sense_id": "44b560a9-9bc0-3c9b-bb94-e6ca0bebe522",
                                                "text": "On souligne dans une copie manuscrite ce qui doit être imprimé en italiques. On souligne les mots, les passages sur lesquels on veut attirer l’attention du lecteur."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cfe6f15a-4149-3b8e-aefd-02fbcad301d4",
                                        "entry_id": "b3485f47-4904-3a91-8630-3e156a853ba3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Signaler à l’attention en insistant."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2680b315-a687-4914-9239-00903e818997",
                                                "sense_id": "cfe6f15a-4149-3b8e-aefd-02fbcad301d4",
                                                "text": "Les effigies qu’on publia de lui soulignaient d’abord une immense moustache noire et, en second lieu, derrière la moustache, un air farouchement irascible."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8bfec935-574f-4f67-9376-4d66c4f1f306",
                                                "sense_id": "cfe6f15a-4149-3b8e-aefd-02fbcad301d4",
                                                "text": "Point besoin de souligner que cette brigade de spahis, […], serait incapable de s’opposer aux chars de la 1ʳᵉ Panzer, quand ceux-ci déboucheraient de la vallée de la Bar et se répandraient dans la dépression de Vendresse au cours de l’après-midi du 14 mai."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b224cb8e-201f-4018-9d3d-8609b8bc1f4b",
                                                "sense_id": "cfe6f15a-4149-3b8e-aefd-02fbcad301d4",
                                                "text": "Il faut souligner que, si les aciers inoxydables ont connu l'extraordinaire développement que nous connaissons, cela est dû à la disponibilité à grande échelle des métaux entrant dans leur composition, […]."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e87b0f0f-fa5e-30f1-aca6-a6fef3171d41",
                                        "entry_id": "b3485f47-4904-3a91-8630-3e156a853ba3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Accentuer ; renforcer."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b11e8301-b620-4da1-990f-5054eea0a6ed",
                                                "sense_id": "e87b0f0f-fa5e-30f1-aca6-a6fef3171d41",
                                                "text": "Le pasteur […] est Juge de Paix et se retrouve sur le banc des magistrats avec son oncle et ses cousins. Ainsi l’armature religieuse du pays souligne et double l’armature politique."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2de9c103-a4db-49a3-a4a1-d47f36275759",
                                                "sense_id": "e87b0f0f-fa5e-30f1-aca6-a6fef3171d41",
                                                "text": "Un jour, alors qu'il est parti, pauvre cœur aux yeux soulignés par des cernes mauvâtres, au dos de plus en plus voûté, à la pâleur carcérale, je décide, prise d'un besoin pressant, de me lever."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ddded2dc-1e46-487c-a83c-6704e3725dc7",
                        "source_entry_id": "af786ea0-d935-39a3-b5b4-618bacff368c",
                        "target_lang_word": "mettre en avant",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "mettre en avant",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ca6ee15c-987f-3600-9ff3-3fef9fd8f00d",
                                        "entry_id": "36ca8b7d-ec8f-3070-868e-6ad352e62d89",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Exposer, donner de l’importance à quelque chose."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ff0e0fde-811d-4b5b-beae-ece79ad8dd2c",
                                                "sense_id": "ca6ee15c-987f-3600-9ff3-3fef9fd8f00d",
                                                "text": "Avec Halloween, nous mettons beaucoup en avant les méchants et, même le reste de l’année, ils sont hypervendeurs, assure José Madrigal, employé de la boutique Archi Chouette, à Lyon."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f5b29e19-d5c4-49b9-81fc-71db6fcae76f",
                                                "sense_id": "ca6ee15c-987f-3600-9ff3-3fef9fd8f00d",
                                                "text": "Depuis les Lumières, de nombreux penseurs avaient mis en avant la nécessité d´avoir une éducation populaire ; […]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f9375ea4-77ef-4674-8433-5b94c4ceda8a",
                                                "sense_id": "ca6ee15c-987f-3600-9ff3-3fef9fd8f00d",
                                                "text": "Il incarne l’Église charitable, mais aussi Emmaüs : le grand public a ainsi pu découvrir récemment l’existence pourtant fondamentale de sa secrétaire Lucie Coutaz, au détour d’un film qui, pour une fois, l’avait un peu mise en avant. Ses autres bras droits sont d’anciens repris de justice, de modestes compagnons ou des notables si hauts placés et affairés qu’ils lui laissent l’affiche."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
